WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
Two photographs. One choice. A researcher returns the other picture.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
Some people explained a face they had not selected.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Later researchers switched jam samples and asked for reasons.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Your first written record matters more than a confident explanation.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Before an audio offer, compare actual features with independent evidence.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
A convenient short session is not a proven hour-long meditation replacement.
